          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.077,
            0.738,
            0.202
          ],
          "content": "In the traditional Indian system of holistic health and medicine called Ayurveda, the herbs or parts of plants are prescribed as remedies. These ingredients like roots, leaves, flowers or seeds of various medicinal plants are often dried in the shade. This practice facilitates the evaporation of excess water, leaving behind the important part of the medicine."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.791,
            0.099,
            0.863,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.772,
            0.161,
            0.866,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": "Do you know?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.232,
            0.447,
            0.254
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity 9.3: Let us investigate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.264,
            0.558,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": "This activity may be demonstrated by the teacher."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.311,
            0.551,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": " Take some salt solution (prepared in Activity 9.2) in a china dish. If a china dish is not available, another suitable vessel may be used."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.413,
            0.211,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
