          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.475,
            0.245,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "Be careful while heating the china dish."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.274,
            0.511,
            0.708,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": " What do you observe? What is left in the china dish?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.559,
            0.747,
            0.602
          ],
          "content": "Did you get the salt back? You can feel the presence of salt in the china dish by touching the salt with your fingers."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.619,
            0.26,
