            0.781,
            0.749,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": "It is now time for Malli and Valli to visit Dada and Dadi (paternal grandparents) residing in Puducherry, located in southern India. They are excited to meet their old neighbourhood friend, Balan. After reaching Puducherry, they start talking about the old times and do not realise that it is already evening, Dadi’s tea time."
        },
